body:
Vanilla Up - a mod that improves some aspects of Minecraft at the discretion of the author. The mod adds several sets of armor, tools, and a couple of items and crafts to Minecraft.

Adds:

Blocks:
Oak Plating;
Spruce Plating;
Dark Oak Plating;
Smooth Blackening.
Steel Block.

Armor:
Copper Set (Oxidized and Waxed Variations);
Emerald Set (Can only be purchased);
Steel Set;
Turtle Set (Grants underwater breathing);

Tools and Weapons:
Copper Set (Oxidized and Waxed Variations);
Emerald Set (Can only be purchased);
Steel Set;
Bone Sharpening;

Items:
Steel (obtained from iron in a smelter);
Illusioner Spawn Egg;
Necklace of the Wanderer (Grants immunity to frost);
Iron Ring;
Trident Crosspiece;
Prismarine Stick;

Crafts:
Trident;
Chain Armor;
Ovens (Different from vanilla);

Mechanics:
Light from a Torch;
Roasting some blocks over a campfire;
Oxidizing Copper Armor and Tools.
